      "content": "\"new opportunities\" ... i don't know. i've done the work. i've seen it all. i feel like i've run my course and there's nothing left to \"grow\" into. it just feels like I'm dragging this heavy, empty body around for no reason. like a book that's already been read and is just sitting on a shelf collecting dust. it doesn't feel like a transition. it just feels finished.",
